            "cn": ["加载", "发现并注册", "运行时上下文"],
            "en": ["Load", "discover and register", "runtime context"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "seg3-02",
          "summary": "First API call has 3 separate fields",
          "cn": "等你发出第一句话，|runtime 把所有准备好的内容和你的消息|一起打包发给模型 API。|这个请求里有三个独立字段：|system——系统提示词，|tools——工具列表，|messages——你的消息。|服务端再把它们合并成模型看到的完整上下文。",
          "en": "When you send your first message,|the runtime bundles everything|and sends it to the model API.|The request has three separate fields:|system — the system prompt,|tools — the tool list,|messages — your message.|The server merges them into the full context the model sees.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["system", "tools", "messages"],
            "en": ["system", "tools", "messages"]
