{
  "episode": {
    "seriesSlug": "ai-agents",
    "episodeSlug": "s01e03",
    "compositionId": "AIAgents-S01E03",
    "previewCnId": "AIAgents-S01E03-Preview-CN",
    "previewEnId": "AIAgents-S01E03-Preview-EN",
    "seriesName": "AI Agents",
    "episodeCode": "S01E03",
    "episodeTitleCn": "为什么 AI Agent 干到一半总会跑偏？",
    "episodeTitleEn": "Why Do AI Agents Drift Mid-Task?",
    "nextEpisodeCode": "S01E04",
    "nextEpisodeTitle": "Hooks 与增强循环",
    "fps": 30,
    "width": 1920,
    "height": 1080,
    "introFrames": 90,
    "outroFrames": 150,
    "cueGapFrames": 3,
    "subtitleSafetyHeight": 200
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "seg1",
      "title": "你让它修个 bug，它修着修着就偏了",
      "targetDurationSeconds": 40,
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "seg1-01",
          "summary": "Setup: submit button spinner bug",
          "cn": "你让 agent 修一个 bug。|提交按钮点了以后，|页面一直转圈，回不来。",
          "en": "You ask the agent to fix a bug.|After the user clicks Submit,|the page keeps spinning and never comes back.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["提交按钮", "一直转圈"],
            "en": ["Submit", "spinning"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "seg1-02",
          "summary": "Agent starts well: reproduce, read files, find logic",
          "cn": "agent 开始干活。|先复现了一遍，确认了能触发。|然后读了两三个文件，|找到了 loading 状态的逻辑。|到这一步，一切都还正常。",
          "en": "The agent starts working.|It reproduces the issue first, confirms it triggers.|Then reads a couple of files,|finds the loading state logic.|So far, everything is fine.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["复现", "loading 状态"],
            "en": ["reproduces", "loading state"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "seg1-03",
          "summary": "Drift: patches loading, tweaks copy, updates import, skips verify",
          "cn": "但接下来它就开始偏了。|它去改了 loading 状态的写法，|改的时候顺手动了一句文案。|然后它又发现|测试文件里有个 import 过时了，|就去更新了一下。|等它跑完这一圈，你翻回去一看 —|它根本没验证 bug 修没修好。",
          "en": "But then it starts to drift.|It rewrites the loading state,|and while it's there, it tweaks a label.|Then it notices|an outdated import in the test file|and updates that too.|By the time it finishes this round, you scroll back —|it never verified whether the bug was actually fixed.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["开始偏了", "没验证"],
            "en": ["starts to drift", "never verified"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "seg1-04",
          "summary": "The real problem: lost the task line",
          "cn": "它不是不会写代码。|它是修着修着，|就把"先复现、再定位、再修、再验证"|这条线给丢了。",
          "en": "It's not that it can't write code.|It's that halfway through,|it lost the thread:|reproduce, isolate, fix, verify.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["这条线给丢了"],
            "en": ["lost the thread"]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "seg2",
      "title": "问题出在哪？上下文把计划给淹了",
      "targetDurationSeconds": 40,
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "seg2-01",
          "summary": "Common misdiagnosis: model not smart enough",
          "cn": "很多人第一反应|是觉得模型不够聪明。|但你仔细看就会发现，|它每一步单独拿出来都是合理的。|它出问题的原因更具体：|它记不住整条线。",
          "en": "Most people's first reaction|is that the model isn't smart enough.|But if you look closely,|every single step it took was individually reasonable.|The real problem is more specific:|it can't hold the whole sequence in mind.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["记不住整条线"],
            "en": ["hold the whole sequence"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "seg2-02",
          "summary": "The loop pushes the original goal away as outputs pile up",
          "cn": "agent loop 每一轮做的事|就三步 —|看当前上下文，选下一个动作，|把结果写回去。|这条回路在前两集已经讲过了。",
          "en": "Each iteration of the agent loop|does three things —|look at the current context, pick the next action,|write the result back.|We covered this loop in the first two episodes.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["看当前上下文", "选下一个动作"],
            "en": ["current context", "pick the next action"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "seg2-03",
          "summary": "Tool outputs bury the original instruction",
          "cn": "问题是，|随着工具输出越堆越多，|上下文里最显眼的东西，|变成了刚读出来的那段代码、|终端里刚跑出来的报错。|你最开始说的那句|"先复现再修再验证"，|已经被推到几千个 token 以前了。",
          "en": "The issue is that|as tool outputs pile up,|what's most visible in context|becomes the code it just read,|the error it just got.|Your original instruction —|reproduce first, then fix, then verify —|has been pushed thousands of tokens back.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["被推到几千个 token 以前"],
            "en": ["thousands of tokens back"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "seg2-04",
          "summary": "The goal didn't disappear, it faded",
          "cn": "模型不是忘了目标。|是目标在它视野里|已经变得很淡了。",
          "en": "The model didn't forget the goal.|The goal just faded from view.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["变得很淡了"],
            "en": ["faded from view"]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "seg3",
      "title": "给它一块记忆板",
      "targetDurationSeconds": 40,
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "seg3-01",
          "summary": "The fix: external memory board, not harder thinking",
          "cn": "工程上的解法|不是让模型想得更久，|而是给它装一块外部记忆板。",
          "en": "The engineering fix|isn't making the model think harder.|It's giving it an external memory board.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["外部记忆板"],
            "en": ["external memory board"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "seg3-02",
          "summary": "Turn the plan into a standalone task board with statuses",
          "cn": "具体来说，|就是把计划从"写在对话里的一段话"，|变成一个独立维护的任务表。|复现做完了，标 completed；|正在定位，标 in progress；|补测试和验证还没做，标 pending。",
          "en": "Concretely,|you turn the plan from a paragraph buried in the chat|into a standalone task board.|Reproduce done, mark completed.|Currently isolating, mark in progress.|Add test and verify, still pending.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["completed", "in progress", "pending"],
            "en": ["completed", "in progress", "pending"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "seg3-03",
          "summary": "TodoWrite is the agent's own working memory",
          "cn": "这就是 TodoWrite 在做的事。|它不是给你看的仪表盘。|它是 agent 自己的工作记忆 —|loop 每转一圈，|都能重新看到这张表，|知道自己走到哪了，|下一步该做什么。",
          "en": "That's what TodoWrite does.|It's not a dashboard for you.|It's the agent's own working memory —|every loop iteration,|it re-reads this board|and knows where it is|and what comes next.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["TodoWrite", "工作记忆"],
            "en": ["TodoWrite", "working memory"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "seg3-04",
          "summary": "Back to the bug: with todo, verify doesn't get skipped",
          "cn": "回到刚才那个 bug。|如果 agent 一开始|就把任务拆成四步写进 todo：|复现、定位、修复、验证。|那它改完 loading 以后，|回头一看任务表 —|"验证"还是 pending。|它就不会去改文案、更新 import，|而是直接去跑验证。",
          "en": "Back to that bug.|If the agent splits the task into four steps at the start —|reproduce, isolate, fix, verify —|then after patching the loading state,|it checks the board.|Verify is still pending.|So instead of tweaking labels and updating imports,|it goes straight to verification.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["任务表", "验证"],
            "en": ["board", "verification"]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "seg4",
      "title": "一个很朴素的约束，就能管住大部分漂移",
      "targetDurationSeconds": 35,
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "seg4-01",
          "summary": "Sounds too simple? Simple constraints are surprisingly effective",
          "cn": "你可能觉得这也太简单了。|一个 todo 列表就能解决？",
          "en": "You might think this sounds too simple.|A todo list fixes it?",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["太简单了"],
            "en": ["too simple"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "seg4-02",
          "summary": "One-in-progress and reminder constraints",
          "cn": "确实简单。|但产品里用了几个很朴素的约束，|效果很好。|比如同一时刻|只允许一个任务是 in progress。|这一条就能压住 agent|同时开好几个坑的冲动。|再比如，|如果 agent 好几步都没更新过任务表，|runtime 会主动提醒它：|你是不是忘了看计划？",
          "en": "It is simple.|But a few plain constraints in production|make it surprisingly effective.|For example,|only one task can be in progress at a time.|That alone suppresses the urge|to open multiple side quests.|And if the agent goes several steps|without updating the board,|the runtime nudges it:|did you forget to check the plan?",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["一个任务是 in progress", "主动提醒"],
            "en": ["one task", "nudges"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "seg4-03",
