  ],
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "seg5-01",
      "summary": "Different platforms, different names, same idea",
      "cn": "不同的平台，|工具的名字不一样。|Claude Code 最早叫 TodoWrite，|后来升级成了 TaskCreate 和 TaskUpdate。|Cursor 也有自己的 TodoWrite。|Codex 则是内置的任务追踪。|但不管叫什么名字，|思路都是一样的——|给 agent 一块|独立于对话的外部记忆。",
      "en": "Different platforms,|different names.|Claude Code started with TodoWrite,|then upgraded to TaskCreate and TaskUpdate.|Cursor has its own TodoWrite.|Codex has built-in task tracking.|But regardless of the name,|the idea is the same —|give the agent|a piece of external memory, separate from the conversation.",
      "highlights": {
        "cn": ["TodoWrite", "TaskCreate", "外部记忆"],
        "en": ["TodoWrite", "TaskCreate", "external memory"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg5-02",
      "summary": "The deeper insight: externalized state is the pattern",
      "cn": "其实说到底，|todo 就是 agent 的外部状态。|对话内容是会流动的——|它会被压缩、被截断、被遗忘。|但外部状态不会。|它挂在那里，|每一步都能读到。|你不需要更聪明的模型，|你只需要一个|不会被淹没的结构化记忆。",
      "en": "At the end of the day,|the todo is the agent's externalized state.|Conversation content flows —|it gets compressed, truncated, forgotten.|But external state doesn't.|It stays there,|readable at every step.|You don't need a smarter model.|You need|a structured memory that doesn't get buried.",
      "highlights": {
        "cn": ["外部状态", "不会被淹没"],
        "en": ["externalized state", "doesn't get buried"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg5-03",
      "summary": "Preview: Hooks — having a plan is step one, but execution needs checkpoints",
      "cn": "下一集我们讲 Hooks——|有了计划是第一步，|但真正执行的时候，|还需要在关键的地方|停下来检查一下。|我们下集见。",
      "en": "Next episode: Hooks —|having a plan is step one,|but when it comes to execution,|you still need to stop and check|at each critical point.|See you next time.",
      "highlights": {
        "cn": ["Hooks", "停下来检查"],
        "en": ["Hooks", "stop and check"]
      }
    }
  ]
}

