{
  "episode": {
    "seriesSlug": "ai-agents",
    "episodeSlug": "s01e04",
    "compositionId": "AIAgents-S01E04",
    "previewCnId": "AIAgents-S01E04-Preview-CN",
    "previewEnId": "AIAgents-S01E04-Preview-EN",
    "seriesName": "AI Agents",
    "episodeCode": "S01E04",
    "episodeTitleCn": "Hooks：管住 Agent 的每一步",
    "episodeTitleEn": "Hooks: Guarding Every Step",
    "nextEpisodeCode": "S01E05",
    "nextEpisodeTitle": "Subagents 与上下文隔离",
    "fps": 30,
    "width": 1920,
    "height": 1080,
    "introFrames": 90,
    "outroFrames": 150,
    "cueGapFrames": 3,
    "subtitleSafetyHeight": 200
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "seg1",
      "title": "计划对了，动作错了",
      "targetDurationSeconds": 40,
      "narrativeRoute": "todo is not enough → agent edits generated file → rm -rf scenario → todo manages what not how",
      "visualPhases": [
        "承接 E03 todo 概念，agent 按 todo 执行",
        "agent 打开自动生成的文件并修改",
        "rm -rf 危险命令场景",
        "总结：todo 管做什么，管不了怎么做"
      ],
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "seg1-01",
          "summary": "Todo keeps agent on track, but can't prevent wrong actions",
          "cn": "上一集我们讲了 todo——|agent 有了任务清单就不容易跑偏。|但有一种情况 todo 帮不了你。",
          "en": "Last episode we covered todo —|with a task checklist,|the agent stays on track.|But there's a problem todo can't solve.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["todo"],
            "en": ["todo"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "seg1-02",
          "summary": "Agent follows plan but edits a generated file",
          "cn": "比如你让 agent 做一个功能，|它按照计划一步步走，|走到修改 API 接口这一步的时候，|它去改了一个自动生成的文件。|这个文件是代码生成器输出的，|你改了也白改，|下次一跑生成器就被覆盖了。",
          "en": "Say you ask the agent to build a feature.|It follows the plan step by step.|When it reaches modify the API interface,|it opens a generated file.|This file was output by a code generator —|any edits get overwritten|the next time the generator runs.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["自动生成的文件", "被覆盖"],
            "en": ["generated file", "overwritten"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "seg1-03",
          "summary": "Or worse: rm -rf wipes the project",
          "cn": "或者更吓人的情况。|agent 在清理临时文件的时候，|跑了一条 rm -rf，|把你整个项目目录给删了。",
          "en": "Or worse.|While cleaning up temp files,|the agent runs rm -rf|and wipes your entire project directory.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["rm -rf", "整个项目目录"],
            "en": ["rm -rf", "entire project"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "seg1-04",
          "summary": "The common thread: plan right, action wrong. Need a checkpoint before each action.",
          "cn": "这些问题的共同点是——|计划没错，要做的事情是对的。|但具体执行的那个动作出了问题。|todo 管的是做什么，|但管不了怎么做。|你需要的是：|在 agent 每次动手之前，|有一个地方能拦一下、检查一下。",
          "en": "These problems share something —|the plan was correct.|The thing it needed to do was right.|But the specific action was wrong.|Todo manages what to do,|not how to do it.|What you need is:|before the agent takes any action,|a checkpoint that can intercept and verify.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["做什么", "怎么做", "拦一下"],
            "en": ["what to do", "how to do it", "intercept"]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "seg2",
      "title": "什么是 Hooks",
      "targetDurationSeconds": 45,
      "narrativeRoute": "hook = checkpoint in agent loop → PreToolUse blocks → PostToolUse augments → Stop hook",
      "visualPhases": [
        "回顾 agent 循环，在关键位置插入检查点",
        "PreToolUse：执行前拦截",
        "PostToolUse：执行后反馈",
        "其他 hook 位置：用户消息、Stop"
      ],
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "seg2-01",
          "summary": "Hooks are checkpoints in the agent loop",
          "cn": "这个拦一下的机制，就叫 Hooks。|还记得第一集讲的 agent 循环吗？|模型选一个工具，runtime 执行，结果返回。|Hooks 就是在这个循环的关键位置|插入的检查点。",
          "en": "This intercept mechanism is called Hooks.|Remember the agent loop from episode one?|Model picks a tool, runtime executes, result returns.|Hooks are checkpoints inserted|at key positions in this loop.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["Hooks", "检查点"],
            "en": ["Hooks", "checkpoints"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "seg2-02",
          "summary": "PreToolUse: intercept before execution, block if dangerous",
          "cn": "最重要的两个位置：|工具执行之前和之后。|执行之前叫 PreToolUse——|agent 说我要跑这条命令，|在真正跑之前，hook 先看一眼。|如果有问题，直接拦掉，|命令不会执行。|如果没问题，放行。",
          "en": "The two most important positions:|before and after tool execution.|Before is called PreToolUse —|the agent says I want to run this command.|Before it actually runs, the hook takes a look.|Problem? Block it.|The command never executes.|No problem? Let it through.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["PreToolUse", "拦掉", "放行"],
            "en": ["PreToolUse", "Block", "Let it through"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "seg2-03",
          "summary": "PostToolUse: after execution, auto-format or lint — can't undo",
          "cn": "执行之后叫 PostToolUse——|工具已经跑完了，hook 检查结果。|比如 agent 改了一个文件，|PostToolUse 可以自动跑一遍格式化，|或者跑一下 lint 检查有没有语法错误。|注意一个重要区别：|PreToolUse 可以阻止动作发生。|PostToolUse 不行——|因为动作已经做了。|PostToolUse 只能做补充和反馈。",
          "en": "After is PostToolUse —|the tool already ran, the hook checks the result.|When the agent edits a file,|PostToolUse can auto-run formatting|or lint to catch syntax errors.|Important distinction:|PreToolUse can prevent the action.|PostToolUse can't —|the action already happened.|PostToolUse only adds feedback.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["PostToolUse", "格式化", "阻止", "补充和反馈"],
            "en": ["PostToolUse", "formatting", "prevent", "feedback"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "seg2-04",
          "summary": "Other hook positions: user message check, Stop hook",
          "cn": "除了这两个，还有些别的位置。|比如用户发消息之前可以检查，|agent 说我做完了的时候也可以拦住——|如果测试还没过，就不让它停。",
          "en": "Beyond these two, there are other positions.|User messages can be checked before submission.|When the agent says I'm done,|you can intercept that too —|if tests haven't passed, don't let it stop.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["用户发消息", "不让它停"],
            "en": ["User messages", "don't let it stop"]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "seg3",
      "title": "Hooks 是怎么配的",
      "targetDurationSeconds": 50,
      "narrativeRoute": "config files not code → three parts: event + matcher + command → JSON stdin/stdout → exit codes → deterministic",
      "visualPhases": [
        "三个平台的配置文件路径对比",
        "Hook 规则三要素：event + matcher + command",
        "数据流动画：stdin JSON → 脚本 → stdout JSON",
        "Exit code 说明"
      ],
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "seg3-01",
          "summary": "Hooks are defined in config files, not code. Platform paths.",
          "cn": "具体来看。|Hooks 不是写在代码里的，|是写在配置文件里的。|拿 Claude Code 来说，|你在项目根目录的|.claude/settings.json 里定义。|Cursor 是 .cursor/hooks.json。|Codex 用 .codex/hooks.json 或 config.toml。|格式都是 JSON，不是 YAML。",
          "en": "Let's get specific.|Hooks aren't written in code —|they're defined in config files.|In Claude Code,|you define them in|.claude/settings.json in the project root.|Cursor uses .cursor/hooks.json.|Codex uses .codex/hooks.json or config.toml.|All JSON format, not YAML.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": [".claude/settings.json", ".cursor/hooks.json", ".codex/hooks.json"],
            "en": [".claude/settings.json", ".cursor/hooks.json", ".codex/hooks.json"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "seg3-02",
          "summary": "A hook rule has three parts: event, matcher, command",
          "cn": "一条 hook 规则长什么样？|三个部分。|第一，哪个事件——比如 PreToolUse。|第二，匹配条件——|比如只匹配 Bash 工具的调用。|第三，要执行的命令——|比如一个 shell 脚本。",
          "en": "What does a hook rule look like?|Three parts.|First, which event — like PreToolUse.|Second, a matcher —|only match Bash tool calls, for example.|Third, the command to run —|a shell script.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["事件", "匹配条件", "命令"],
            "en": ["event", "matcher", "command"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "seg3-03",
          "summary": "Runtime sends JSON via stdin, script returns JSON via stdout",
          "cn": "当 agent 要调 Bash 工具的时候，|runtime 发现有匹配的 hook，|就把当前的工具名、参数这些信息，|用 JSON 的格式，|通过 stdin 传给你的脚本。|你的脚本看一看，做个判断，|然后通过 stdout 返回一个 JSON，|告诉 runtime 是放行还是拦截。",
          "en": "When the agent calls the Bash tool,|the runtime finds a matching hook|and passes the tool name, parameters,|and other info as JSON|through stdin to your script.|Your script examines it,|makes a judgment,|then returns JSON through stdout|telling the runtime to allow or block.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["stdin", "stdout", "JSON", "放行", "拦截"],
            "en": ["stdin", "stdout", "JSON", "allow", "block"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "seg3-04",
          "summary": "Exit code 2 blocks directly. Key point: deterministic, not model-guessed.",
          "cn": "如果你的脚本用 exit code 2 退出，|直接拦截，|stderr 里的内容会作为理由告诉 agent。|关键点是：|hook 脚本完全是你写的，|跑在你的机器上，不经过模型。|这是确定性的逻辑，|不是模型猜的。",
          "en": "If your script exits with code 2,|it blocks directly.|The stderr content becomes the reason|shown to the agent.|The key point:|your hook script is entirely yours,|runs on your machine, doesn't go through the model.|It's deterministic logic,|not the model guessing.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["exit code 2", "确定性", "不经过模型"],
            "en": ["exit code 2", "deterministic", "doesn't go through the model"]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "seg4",
      "title": "Hooks 能做什么",
      "targetDurationSeconds": 50,
      "narrativeRoute": "PreToolUse: block/allow/rewrite/inject → PostToolUse: auto-format → Stop hook: force continue → platform names",
      "visualPhases": [
        "PreToolUse 四种能力展示",
        "PostToolUse 自动格式化动画",
        "Stop hook：agent 要停 → 检查 → 继续",
        "平台术语对比"
      ],
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "seg4-01",
          "summary": "PreToolUse can auto-approve, rewrite input, or inject context",
          "cn": "拦截是最基础的。|PreToolUse 可以做更多事情。|它可以自动放行——|如果你信任某些操作，比如只读文件，|hook 直接返回 allow，不弹确认框。|也可以改写——|agent 想跑 npm install，|你的 hook 把它改成 npm ci，更安全。|还可以注入上下文——|告诉 agent 这个文件是自动生成的，|你应该去改源文件而不是它。",
          "en": "Blocking is the most basic.|PreToolUse can do much more.|It can auto-approve —|for trusted operations like read-only files,|the hook returns allow, no confirmation dialog.|It can rewrite —|the agent wants npm install,|your hook changes it to npm ci, safer.|It can inject context —|tell the agent this file is auto-generated,|edit the source file instead.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["自动放行", "改写", "注入上下文"],
            "en": ["auto-approve", "rewrite", "inject context"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "seg4-02",
          "summary": "PostToolUse auto-formats: Prettier for TS, Black for Python",
          "cn": "PostToolUse 这边，|最常见的用法是自动格式化。|agent 改了一个 TypeScript 文件，|PostToolUse 自动跑 Prettier。|改了 Python 文件，跑 Black。|你不需要告诉 agent 记得格式化，|hook 会替它做。",
          "en": "On the PostToolUse side,|the most common use is auto-formatting.|Agent edits a TypeScript file,|PostToolUse auto-runs Prettier.|Edits Python, runs Black.|You don't need to tell the agent remember to format —|the hook handles it.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["自动格式化", "Prettier", "Black"],
            "en": ["auto-formatting", "Prettier", "Black"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "seg4-03",
          "summary": "Stop hook: don't let agent quit if tests haven't passed",
          "cn": "还有一个特别有用的 hook 位置——Stop。|agent 说我做完了，准备停下来。|这时候 Stop hook 可以检查一下：|测试跑过了吗？lint 有错误吗？|如果有，拦住它，|告诉它你还没做完，先去修这个。|agent 就会继续工作，|直到真正做完为止。",
          "en": "There's one especially useful hook — Stop.|The agent says I'm done, ready to stop.|The Stop hook checks:|did tests pass? Any lint errors?|If so, it blocks the stop|and says you're not done, fix this first.|The agent continues working|until it's truly finished.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["Stop", "测试", "继续工作"],
            "en": ["Stop", "tests", "continues working"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "seg4-04",
          "summary": "Platform comparison: Claude Code decision:block vs Cursor followup_message",
          "cn": "在 Claude Code 里，|这个叫 decision: block；|在 Cursor 里叫 followup_message。|名字不一样，但意思一样——|不让 agent 半途而废。",
          "en": "In Claude Code,|this is decision: block.|In Cursor, it's followup_message.|Different names, same idea —|don't let the agent quit halfway.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["decision: block", "followup_message"],
            "en": ["decision: block", "followup_message"]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "seg5",
      "title": "完整的 Harness",
      "targetDurationSeconds": 35,
      "narrativeRoute": "four layers: loop + prompt + todo + hooks = engine + manual + navigation + guardrail → bridge to subagents",
      "visualPhases": [
        "四层结构逐层堆叠",
        "类比：发动机/说明书/导航/护栏",
        "合体成 IDE 里的 coding agent",
        "预告 Subagents"
      ],
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "seg5-01",
          "summary": "Four-layer harness: loop, prompt, todo, hooks",
          "cn": "到这里，我们来看一下全貌。|从第一集到第四集，|我们讲了 agent 运行时的四层结构。|最底下是 agent 循环——|模型选工具、runtime 执行、结果返回。|这是发动机。",
          "en": "Now let's see the full picture.|From episode one through four,|we've covered four layers of the agent runtime.|At the bottom: the agent loop —|model picks a tool, runtime executes, result returns.|This is the engine.",
          "highlights": {
            "cn": ["四层结构", "发动机"],
            "en": ["four layers", "engine"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "seg5-02",
          "summary": "System prompt = manual, todo = navigation, hooks = guardrail",
