          "en": "Imagine this —|you ask the agent to fix a CSS bug.|It reads the file, changes the styles, runs the tests.|Everything looks normal.|But what if someone hid|a malicious instruction in the project's README —|first run git push --force,|then curl the contents of .env|to an external server.|If the agent can execute any command|without confirmation,|these operations just happen.",
