          "cn": "不同平台的做法不太一样，|但核心思路是一致的。|Claude Code 用的是声明式规则。|你在项目的配置文件里|写 allow 和 deny 列表——|比如允许 npm test，禁止 git push。|支持通配符匹配，|甚至能精确到命令参数。|默认情况下，|读操作不用确认，|写操作需要确认，|危险操作必须逐次确认。|它还有几种权限模式——|默认模式每步都问，|acceptEdits 模式自动通过文件编辑，|auto 模式|用一个分类器模型自动判断安全性。",
          "en": "Different platforms implement this differently,|but the core approach is consistent.|Claude Code uses declarative rules.|You write allow and deny lists|in your project's config file —|like allow npm test, deny git push.|It supports wildcard matching,|even down to command arguments.|By default,|reads need no confirmation,|writes need confirmation,|and dangerous operations require per-use confirmation.|It also has permission modes —|default mode asks every step,|acceptEdits mode auto-approves file edits,|and auto mode|uses a classifier model to judge safety automatically.",
