        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "seg5",
      "title": "自动化和信任的平衡",
      "targetDurationSeconds": 35,
      "narrativeRoute": "too strict vs too loose → context-dependent modes → deny in config survives compaction → prompt ≠ permission → agent becomes bounded partner",
      "visualPhases": [
        "太严格 vs 太松",
        "分场景的模式选择",
        "deny 规则 vs 提示词约束",
        "有边界的协作伙伴"
